              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "We work directly with manufacturing partners and established fencing brands worldwide to source reliable equipment and keep quality consistent. Fencing Club is a direct retailer that holds its own inventory.",
