                      "gap": 32,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "A7ygi",
                          "name": "Policy introduction",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "This Return & Refund Policy applies to purchases made at the fencing.club website.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "j1qyO",
                          "name": "Policy section 1",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 16,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "vl6Y5",
                              "name": "Policy heading 1",
                              "context": "Published H2. Anchor policy-section-1",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Can I return or exchange my purchase?",
                              "lineHeight": 1.35,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                              "fontSize": 22,
                              "fontWeight": "600"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "JHMVB",
                              "name": "Policy paragraph 1-1",
                              "context": "Verbatim published paragraph. Source inline links: order history -> https://account.fencing.club/orders; support@fencing.club -> mailto:support@fencing.club. Address line breaks preserved.",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "We offer a free 30-day return policy from the date of receipt of the purchased item, during which you may request a refund or exchange. For eligible domestic returns, we provide free return shipping.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "vTiKc",
                              "name": "Policy paragraph 1-2",
                              "context": "Verbatim published paragraph. Source inline links: order history -> https://account.fencing.club/orders; support@fencing.club -> mailto:support@fencing.club. Address line breaks preserved.",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "For holiday orders, purchases made in November and December are eligible for free returns or exchanges through January 5, or within 30 days of receipt, whichever comes later. All holiday returns must still be initiated within the applicable return window.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "D5u4q",
                              "name": "Policy paragraph 1-3",
                              "context": "Verbatim published paragraph. Source inline links: order history -> https://account.fencing.club/orders; support@fencing.club -> mailto:support@fencing.club. Address line breaks preserved.",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "To be eligible for a return with a full refund, your item must be in the same condition in which it was received: unworn or unused, with tags, and in its original packaging. If you received a defective, damaged, or incorrect item, please provide photos or videos as proof.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Pzhy7",
                              "name": "Policy paragraph 1-4",
                              "context": "Verbatim published paragraph. Source inline links: order history -> https://account.fencing.club/orders; support@fencing.club -> mailto:support@fencing.club. Address line breaks preserved.",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Returns that meet the full-refund condition requirements above do not incur a restocking fee. If a non-defective return is received in a condition that does not meet those requirements, a deduction of up to 20% of the item price may apply after inspection. Any applicable deduction will be taken from the item price only.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
