                          "context": "Published Privacy Policy paragraph; retain wording and source anchors. Capture date 2026-09-06.",
                          "fill": "$ink",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "The types of personal information we obtain about you depends on how you interact with our Site and use our Services. When we use the term \"personal information\", we are referring to information that identifies, relates to, describes or can be associated with you. The following sections describe the categories and specific types of personal information we collect.",
