                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Prices for our products are subject to change without notice.\n\nWe reserve the right at any time to modify or discontinue the Service (or any part or content thereof) without notice at any time.\n\nWe shall not be liable to you or to any third-party for any modification, price change, suspension or discontinuance of the Service.",
